# Licence allowlist for the `licence` CI stage (HARNESS.md §1.3 stage 7, AGENTS.md §5.7).
# bob is AGPL-3.0. Allowed: permissive licences and MPL-2.0 (file-level copyleft).
# GPL, AGPL and LGPL can never be allowed wholesale (the parser rejects it);
# a single dependency may pass as an exception that names an owner decision:
#   except <go module path | npm:<name>> <SPDX> D<n> <note>
allow MIT
allow BSD-2-Clause
allow BSD-3-Clause
allow Apache-2.0
allow ISC
allow MPL-2.0
allow Unlicense
allow CC0-1.0
allow Zlib
